"},{"id":160535683,"discussion_id":"21ac9a75bad218fcce4bb0fc2e939113a8fb69aa","body":"### CLA Signature Pass  \n mirror-center, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-20T11:06:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T11:06:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160535705,"discussion_id":"320a99e1b689a717b08ac77607af986fb6c295e5","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-20T11:06:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T11:06:37+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160535920,"discussion_id":"650ef3fa0955a6ac95e3521661c52e971c6454be","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化Flash Attention算子中针对Sink机制的事件同步逻辑。原实现中，`hasSink`场景下的同步逻辑复杂且存在冗余代码，同时存在潜在的条件判断错误，可能导致事件触发条件不一致。本次修改通过重构代码，旨在简化逻辑并确保不同场景下事件同步的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心方案是移除专门为Sink场景引入的冗余事件`eventIdVToMte2Sink`及其相关等待和设置逻辑。通过将Sink场景下的`SetFlag`操作统一合并到现有的`eventIdVToMte2A`事件上，并修正非Sink场景下的条件判断（避免在`hasSink`为`true`时误触发），实现了事件流的简化和逻辑的统一。此修改消除了代码冗余，提升了代码可读性与健壮性。","created_at":"2026-01-20T11:06:59+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-20T11:06:59+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703"